HST Office release version (1.0.0) independent of the LibreOffice engine version.

The engine version (26.8.1.1) stays what configure/postprocess define: it feeds
extension compatibility checks, document generator metadata, first-run detection
and the PDF producer. Only what the user sees and what is installed carries the
HST version, which comes from /VERSION via scripts/write-hst-version.py:

- include/hst_version.h (generated, not part of this patch) defines HST_VERSION.
- About dialog: "<HST version> (<arch>)"; "Copy version info" adds an "Engine:"
  line with the LibreOffice engine version (read at run time) for support tickets.
- soffice --version: "<product> <HST version> <build id>".
- Installer and launcher naming use the same HST version (hst-packaging*.patch).
- Bundled extension "HST Vietnamese tools": built from the HST repository by
  dictionaries/ExtensionPackage_hst-vietnamese-tools.mk, unpacked into
  share/extensions and listed for the brand package in scp2.

License: modified upstream files keep their license (MPL-2.0).
